From 60f6c6d6ac396686328c2edca011b9f8139571a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Javier Maestro <jjmaestro@ieee.org>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 12:23:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] patch: honor the PYTHON build option when probing plpython

`pm.find_installation()` called with no positional argument does not
search a `PATH`: meson's python module falls back to
`mesonlib.python_command`, which is `[sys.executable]`, so the
installation it returns is *the interpreter meson itself is running
under*.

Under a build that runs meson as a wrapped `py_binary`, that is the
build tool's own interpreter and not the one PostgreSQL resolved for
`PYTHON`. Both get probed, and only the second has the development
files:

  Program .../python_sysroot/debian/13/amd64/usr/bin/python3 found: YES
  Program .../meson_tool.runfiles/..._meson_tool.venv/bin/python3 found: YES

`dependency(embed: true)` then looks for the *build tool* interpreter's
embed files, whose `INCLUDEPY` and `LIBDIR` point outside the build
sandbox and which has no matching `python-3.x-embed.pc` on
`PKG_CONFIG_PATH`, and fails. With `plpython` enabled rather than auto
that is fatal:

  meson.build:1075:29: ERROR: Python dependency not found

Pass `python.path()`, the program
`find_program(get_option('PYTHON'), native: true)` already resolved at
the top of this file, so the installation probed is the one plpython is
actually built against, and its `python-3.x-embed` is the one the
sysroot provides.

Upstream fixed this in `489ca33081c8` ("meson: Improve/fix Python
version selection"), back-patched to REL_16_STABLE as `1f5e38847b26`
and first released in 16.2. That back-patch does not apply verbatim
here, because it carries context from `c79ca0485a62` ("meson: Make
detection of python more robust", first released in 16.1) which this
release predates, so only its one-line change is taken.

Deliberately `path()` and not `full_path()`: master later switched to
`full_path()` in `aa11a9c14902`, which was not back-patched, and
`path()` is what the release branches use.

References: https://postgr.es/c/489ca33081
References: https://postgr.es/c/1f5e38847b
---
 meson.build | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index 38e4f03e60..35307144c6 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -1054,7 +1054,7 @@ endif
 pyopt = get_option('plpython')
 if not pyopt.disabled()
   pm = import('python')
-  python3_inst = pm.find_installation(required: pyopt)
+  python3_inst = pm.find_installation(python.path(), required: pyopt)
   python3_dep = python3_inst.dependency(embed: true, required: pyopt)
   if not cc.check_header('Python.h', dependencies: python3_dep, required: pyopt)
     python3_dep = not_found_dep
